From 593ab9ba1c68850d68c7025e343de9ab2b782f0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben van der Linde <ruben@conduction.nl>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:03:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(portaliq): build
 site-member-voting-record-and-confidential-papers [skip ci]

The public records block renders on the plain page for readers without
JavaScript: the list with a GET search, a record with its figures, rows,
links and the way back, and the stale-link sentence. The record id comes
from ?record= and is kept in the link to the full page.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
